        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-ANNSIM-ADVANCED-THEOREMS-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-ADVANCED-THEOREMS-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-BACNET-IFC-TYPING-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-COV-DEADBAND-LIMIT-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-MULTI-TENANT-ISOLATE-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-VAV-DAMPER-CHATTER-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-IOT-BAS-CALIBRATION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-ADVANCED-PROOF-WITNESS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ADVANCED-THEOREMS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-ADVANCED-THEOREMS.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-BACNET-IFC-TYPING-OK = 1 AND
               WS-COV-DEADBAND-LIMIT-OK = 1 AND
               WS-MULTI-TENANT-ISOLATE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-VAV-DAMPER-CHATTER-OK = 1 AND
               WS-IOT-BAS-CALIBRATION-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-ADVANCED-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-ADVANCED-PROOF-WITNESS.
